WEBVTT

00:02:28.113 --> 00:02:30.814
I doubt you'd get the same response,

00:02:30.814 --> 00:02:32.261
even though Maersk,

00:02:32.261 --> 00:02:35.952
which is just one shipping company amongst many,

00:02:35.952 --> 00:02:38.934
has revenues pretty much on a par with Microsoft.

00:02:38.934 --> 00:02:40.415
[$60.2 billion]

00:02:40.415 --> 00:02:42.338
Now why is this?

00:02:42.338 --> 00:02:44.251
A few years ago,

00:02:44.251 --> 00:02:47.523
the first sea lord of the British admiralty --

00:02:47.523 --> 00:02:49.328
he is called the first sea lord,

00:02:49.328 --> 00:02:53.823
although the chief of the army is not called a land lord —

00:02:53.823 --> 00:02:56.266
he said that we, and he meant

00:02:56.266 --> 00:02:58.948
in the industrialized nations in the West,

00:02:58.948 --> 00:03:02.760
that we suffer from sea blindness.